### English summary

**All rights reserved. This is NOT open source.**

Reproduction, redistribution, derivative works, and bulk scraping of the collected
datasets are **prohibited** without prior written permission. Reading the code for
personal study, short quotations with attribution, and normal use of the deployed
site are permitted.

Most underlying data originates from **Korean public data sources**; copyright and
terms for that data belong to the respective providers and are **not covered by this
license** — see [`SOURCES.md`](SOURCES.md) for the full list grouped by terms.
Note that some sources are **not** public data (Kakao, Naver, ODsay, OpenStreetMap):
Kakao place data is **display-only** (no storage or redistribution), and OpenStreetMap
tiles are ODbL and require the `© OpenStreetMap contributors` notice.

Provided **AS IS** with no warranty. Displayed real-estate, auction, and transaction
figures are **for reference only** and may reproduce errors present in the source data.
Verify with official records before making any decision.

Contact: conoc612@gmail.com
